    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The hobgoblin makes two attacks, using Greatsword or Longbow in any combination.\n\nGreatsword. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (2d6 + 2) Slashing damage plus 3 (1d6) Poison damage.\n\nLongbow. Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 150/600 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Piercing damage plus 5 (2d4) Poison damage.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.137",
